# Upstream skills manifest (DATA) — consumed by scripts/sync-upstream-skills.sh
#
# Line types (whitespace-separated; blank lines and #-comments ignored):
#   repo  <key>        <git-url>
#   skill <repo-key>   <path/inside/upstream/repo>   <dest-folder-in-this-repo>
#
# The sync script downloads ONLY the listed folders (partial + sparse checkout)
# and copies each into a per-source folder `<repo-key>/<dest>/`. After each copy
# it rewrites the skill's
# SKILL.md `name:` field to match <dest-folder>, so you may rename freely (e.g.
# learn -> waza-learn) and the skill stays valid AND re-syncable.

